<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Ibrahim Shah</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Ibrahim Shah was a nephew of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/nader-shah">Nader Shah</a> and briefly a ruler of the Afsharid state. He fought a civil war against his brother <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/adil-shah">Adil Shah</a> in 1747–1748 after Nader's assassination. The conflict reduced the remnant of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/afsharid-empire">Afsharid Empire</a> to chaos.</p></div>
